Reason: port: with frame_rate = 60 Shadow Mario's fruit-kick stun and HP-meter timers count down at the 30 fps rate; perform counts them on every call, and the per-frame calls double at 60, so both ran out 30% sooner
--- a/src/Enemy/enemyMario.cpp
+++ b/src/Enemy/enemyMario.cpp
@@ -1851,6 +1851,22 @@ void TEnemyMario::drawHPMeter(MtxPtr viewMtx)
